# Only publish released versions: codename tags that also have a version
# number (e.g. trixie, 13), plus the stable alias. This skips testing
# (currently forky), unstable/sid, experimental, rc-buggy, backports and
# oldstable, and picks up each new codename once it is released.
# FILTER is word-split without quote removal, so patterns can't contain
# spaces; the "." matches the space in the ", " tag separator.
FILTER="grep -e ,.[0-9] -e ^stable,"
